# Lindblum, Industrial Regency // Mage Siege, a land card with an Adventure (CR 715). In Bot2's turn 2 Bot1 casts Mage
# Siege, an instant, from its hand (CR 715.3a: only the Adventure is judged, so the land card is cast), and gets the 0/1
# black Wizard; the card is exiled on its adventure (CR 715.3d). "For as long as that card remains exiled, that player may
# play it": in turn 3 Bot1 has played a Mountain, so playing Lindblum from exile is refused (one land play, CR 305.2), as
# is casting Mage Siege again from there (CR 715.3d); in turn 5 it is played from exile and enters tapped. Then Mox Pearl,
# a noncreature spell, makes the Wizard deal 1 damage to Bot2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Lindblum, Industrial Regency
Mountain
Mox Pearl
Island
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lindblum, Industrial Regency.Cast(Ability: Adventure)
? Stack = Mage Siege
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile = Lindblum, Industrial Regency
? Bot1.Battlefield.Wizard Token.Power = 0
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
! Bot1.Exile.Lindblum, Industrial Regency.Play
! Bot1.Exile.Lindblum, Industrial Regency.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Exile.Lindblum, Industrial Regency.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Lindblum, Industrial Regency.Tapped = true
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Lindblum, Industrial Regency.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Wizard Token.Toughness = 1
Bot2.Life = 19
